WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.184
Everybody, STOP! Don't move!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.896
OhBhai? What's happening?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.200
Look behind that tree.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.256
Mom... was that a giant cat?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.736
Not just a cat, sweetheart. That's a predator.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.680
We need to leave. Right now.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.456
Wait. Nobody here is bleeding. So... whose blood is this?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.728
We have 100 hours until the rescue team can reach this side of the jungle. One hundred hours. And I promise you... we're getting out together.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.872
Grandpa, are we lost?

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.520
No, little one. We're finding another way.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.880
Dad, you've been walking for hours. Please sit down.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.896
I'm fine. I just need a minute.

00:01:58.896 --> 00:02:04.536
There's an old ranger tower across the river. It has an emergency radio. If we reach it, we can call for help.

00:02:06.896 --> 00:02:08.076
And how far is it?

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:11.436
About twelve kilometers.

00:02:12.896 --> 00:02:15.346
Twelve?! With a child and a pregnant woman?

00:02:16.896 --> 00:02:19.126
I know. But it's the only route left.

00:02:20.896 --> 00:02:22.716
Look! Someone walked here.

00:02:23.896 --> 00:02:25.646
Those aren't human footprints.

00:02:26.896 --> 00:02:29.756
Everybody stay close. Something is injured out here.

00:02:30.896 --> 00:02:32.986
Please tell me that's not human blood.

00:02:34.896 --> 00:02:43.466
Look at the tracks. A wild animal passed through here. And this blood is old — hours old. Whatever was bleeding... it's been bleeding since this morning.

00:02:43.766 --> 00:02:44.726
Is it hurt?

00:02:45.896 --> 00:02:48.126
Maybe. But that doesn't mean it's safe.

00:02:50.896 --> 00:02:52.216
GET BEHIND THE TREE!

00:02:55.896 --> 00:02:57.356
I thought it was going to hit us!

00:04:59.356 --> 00:05:01.376
Oh, sweetheart. Come here.

00:05:01.676 --> 00:05:06.396
That animal was frightened. A boar doesn't run from us. It runs from what's behind us.

00:05:09.356 --> 00:05:10.486
Something bigger?

00:05:12.356 --> 00:05:14.446
Something that doesn't want us here.

00:05:15.356 --> 00:05:17.736
Whatever chased it... is still here.

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:25.396
OhBhai... can you tell me a story?

00:05:26.356 --> 00:05:30.916
Of course. Once upon a time, there was a brave little girl who wasn't afraid of anything.

00:05:31.356 --> 00:05:33.806
That's not true. I'm scared right now.

00:05:34.356 --> 00:05:38.216
Being brave doesn't mean you aren't scared. It means you don't give up.

00:05:38.516 --> 00:05:40.776
She's been asking me all day when we're going home.

00:05:42.356 --> 00:05:44.326
She'll go home. I promise.

00:05:45.356 --> 00:05:49.216
Dad... I'm worried about you too. You keep pretending you're okay.

00:05:49.516 --> 00:05:51.996
I've lived long enough to know when my family needs me.

00:05:53.356 --> 00:05:55.256
Grandpa... something's there.

00:05:56.356 --> 00:05:59.216
Nobody move. It's not one animal. It's circling us.

00:09:23.216 --> 00:09:24.606
Mom, I'm scared!

00:09:26.216 --> 00:09:29.216
Look at me, sweetheart. Not the water. Look at me.

00:09:30.216 --> 00:09:31.896
STOP! Don't move!

00:09:33.216 --> 00:09:34.126
What's that?

00:09:36.216 --> 00:09:38.306
Just keep moving. Slowly!

00:09:38.716 --> 00:09:39.556
AMINA!

00:09:39.856 --> 00:09:40.986
KEEP GOING!

00:13:23.986 --> 00:13:25.256
GO! GO! GO!

00:13:27.986 --> 00:13:30.246
I don't want to go near water ever again!

00:13:31.986 --> 00:13:33.446
Neither do I, little one.

00:13:35.986 --> 00:13:40.856
It could have crossed. It didn't. It's not hunting us... it's watching us.

00:13:44.986 --> 00:13:52.786
Wait. These tracks... they're the same ones from yesterday. Same size. Same direction. It's been following us since the first hour.

00:13:53.086 --> 00:13:54.286
It's following us.

00:13:55.986 --> 00:13:57.856
Why? What does it want?

00:13:58.986 --> 00:14:02.636
Maybe it doesn't want us. Maybe we're walking through its territory.

00:14:03.986 --> 00:14:05.376
There's something crying.

00:14:06.986 --> 00:14:08.736
Stay here. Don't move.

00:14:10.986 --> 00:14:11.756
Oh no...

00:14:13.986 --> 00:14:14.826
What is it?

00:14:16.986 --> 00:14:18.356
A baby jaguar.

00:19:01.356 --> 00:19:02.816
That explains the tracks.

00:19:04.356 --> 00:19:11.126
And the blood. It was never ours. It was the cub's. This whole time... the blood was leading us here.

00:19:12.356 --> 00:19:14.036
OHBHAI! GET AWAY FROM IT!

00:19:15.356 --> 00:19:17.586
Everybody back away. Slowly.

00:19:19.356 --> 00:19:22.426
She's not trying to hurt us. She's looking for her baby.

00:19:22.726 --> 00:19:26.116
She is still dangerous, sweetheart. We need to give her space.

00:19:26.416 --> 00:19:28.456
We have to get out of here. Now.

00:19:32.356 --> 00:19:34.036
Sara? Are you okay?

00:19:35.356 --> 00:19:38.886
I'm tired. The baby keeps moving. I'm just scared.

00:19:39.356 --> 00:19:40.486
Come here, sweetheart.

00:19:42.356 --> 00:19:44.296
Dad... what if we don't make it?

00:19:45.356 --> 00:19:52.726
Listen to me. I held you when you were a little girl. I carried you through storms, through sickness, through everything. I'm not leaving you now.

00:19:53.356 --> 00:19:55.826
I just want my children to grow up somewhere safe.

00:19:56.356 --> 00:19:59.426
They will. I won't let this jungle take your family.

00:25:42.426 --> 00:25:44.246
It's still trying to reach its baby.

00:25:45.426 --> 00:25:48.086
That cub won't survive the night if we leave it like that.

00:25:49.426 --> 00:25:50.456
Can we help it?

00:25:52.426 --> 00:25:57.396
If we go near it, the mother kills us. If we leave it, it dies. That's the choice.

00:25:57.696 --> 00:25:59.876
Then we help it. From a distance.

00:26:01.426 --> 00:26:02.816
GO! RUN!

00:26:05.426 --> 00:26:06.626
We helped her baby.

00:26:08.426 --> 00:26:13.156
And she'll remember that. And now we leave. Before anything else finds us.

00:26:13.456 --> 00:26:15.346
I can't. I can't go through there.

00:26:17.426 --> 00:26:22.686
Don't look at them. Look at me. Same as your mother said at the river. One step. Then another.

00:26:24.426 --> 00:26:26.466
The ranger tower should be just ahead!

00:26:28.426 --> 00:26:29.936
I can't walk much further.

00:26:31.426 --> 00:26:34.496
Then we rest for one minute. Not one second more.

00:26:35.426 --> 00:26:37.176
Look! The eyes again!

00:26:38.426 --> 00:26:40.396
Please... not again.

